# Wire features into UI (same change)

Jab bhi naya feature / screen / API flow bane, **usi chat / PR mein** product UI entrypoint bhi wire karo. Backend-only stub + orphan route mat chhodo.

## Required
- Agent web (`apps/web`): sidebar / header menus / dashboard CTAs jahan user naturally dhundhega
- Admin (`apps/admin-web`): matching nav or section if admins use it
- Mobile (`apps/mobile`): tab / home tile / stack route if InstantPay parity applies (see `AGENTS.md`)

## Placement examples
- **Fund request / Add Money** → under **Wallet** (dropdown / wallet actions), not a lone top-level sidebar item
- Wallet-related actions stay together: Overview · Add Money · Transfer · Statement (and Refresh where a balance pill exists)
- New money flows → Wallet or the service category they belong to — not a random orphan menu row

## Done check
- [ ] User can reach the screen from nav or an obvious in-app CTA (not only by typing the URL)
- [ ] Label is English product copy (`ui-english-only`)
- [ ] Role gating matches API (e.g. retailer-only fund request)
